# Bundle 8 (bug-0.10.0-mappedin-static-swift-framework) regression fixture.
# The detection-order test needs a real xcframework with a static `ar archive`
# binary AND a non-empty `.swiftinterface` committed in tree, so override the
# blanket `*.swiftmodule` / `*.swiftdoc` / `*.swiftsourceinfo` ignores for the
# fixture path. Rebuilding (Fixtures/StaticSwift/build.sh) requires Xcode + a
# Swift toolchain — committing the artifacts keeps the regression test
# reproducible on machines without that.
!Fixtures/StaticSwift/StaticSwiftLib.xcframework/**
